   "protocol_version": 14,
   "reason": "Renderer-only improvements using existing wire messages: chess grids use joined alternating squares and visible selection borders; tile titles are drawn at the size they were measured at, so a two line book title no longer overflows its cell and collide with the book beside it; crossword squares share one rule per line instead of two and are held to a printed square's size, and their letters are set in body rather than heading. No protocol, node or action changes. Applications whose own sources changed are versioned separately.",
