  {
   "protocol_version": 14,
   "reason": "Take rustls 0.23.45 so TLS 1.3 handshake messages cannot be accepted across encryption-level boundaries (RUSTSEC-2026-0285), and advance workspace-local package versions to 0.3.15, then to 0.3.16 for the Birds companion. Re-pinned over the Windows host support: the lock also gains the kobo-sdk to kobo-abi edge and Windows-target packages for the CLI, sidekickd, and wifi-trace, none of which resolves differently for a Unix build. Store apps keep their existing messages; the patched stack reaches readers in the next platform package.",
   "files": [
    {
     "path": "Cargo.lock",
